WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.961
"I have to get to Sunshine Coffee Shop," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:04.962 --> 00:00:08.759
"Zombies are hurting people!"

3
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.016
Roxy went back to the table.

4
00:00:11.017 --> 00:00:18.212
"I just remembered. I, uh, need to help Principal Penn!"

5
00:00:18.213 --> 00:00:22.195
Roxy ran down the hall.

6
00:00:22.196 --> 00:00:32.356
She threw open the door and leaped into the sky.

7
00:00:32.357 --> 00:00:35.739
*** People stood outside Sunshine Coffee

8
00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:40.400
Shop. When Roxy got closer, she saw they were not normal

9
00:00:40.401 --> 00:00:42.232
people. Their eyes were

10
00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:44.190
blank. Their hair was

11
00:00:44.191 --> 00:00:47.978
messy. And they moved in a strange

12
00:00:47.979 --> 00:00:51.286
way. "Zombies!" Roxy

13
00:00:51.287 --> 00:00:54.355
said. A woman was in the doorway of Sunshine Coffee

14
00:00:54.356 --> 00:00:56.896
Shop. She was waving zombies away with a

15
00:00:56.897 --> 00:01:01.799
broom. The zombies' mouths snapped open and

16
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:06.104
shut. "Get out of here!" the woman

17
00:01:06.105 --> 00:01:10.563
yelled. Roxy swooped down and pushed the zombies away from the

18
00:01:10.564 --> 00:01:13.823
door. Then she ran in with the

19
00:01:13.824 --> 00:01:17.314
woman. The woman locked the door behind

20
00:01:17.315 --> 00:01:20.989
her. "Whew!" The woman ran a hand across her

21
00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:25.958
forehead. "That was scary! I'm glad you're here, Rocket

22
00:01:25.959 --> 00:01:28.747
Girl." "No problem," Roxy

23
00:01:28.748 --> 00:01:31.117
said. Suddenly she spotted Detective

24
00:01:31.118 --> 00:01:34.591
Smith. He stood up near a case with only a few donuts

25
00:01:34.592 --> 00:01:36.943
left. His hair was

26
00:01:36.944 --> 00:01:42.433
messy. "Ahh!" Roxy cried. "It's another

27
00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:44.249
zombie!" Detective Smith

28
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.045
frowned. "Very funny, Rocket

29
00:01:47.046 --> 00:01:49.205
Girl." He tried to pat down his

30
00:01:49.206 --> 00:01:53.138
hair. "I forgot to brush my hair this morning."

31
00:01:53.139 --> 00:01:55.290
Roxy pointed out the window.

32
00:01:55.291 --> 00:01:58.762
"What turned all those people into zombies?"

33
00:01:58.763 --> 00:02:01.038
Detective Smith scratched his head.

34
00:02:01.039 --> 00:02:05.304
His hair got messier. "I'm not sure."

35
00:02:05.305 --> 00:02:07.282
The woman pointed at the case.

36
00:02:07.283 --> 00:02:09.797
"It was those donuts."

37
00:02:09.798 --> 00:02:12.553
"How do you know?" Roxy asked.

38
00:02:12.554 --> 00:02:15.604
"A man came in earlier," she said.

39
00:02:15.605 --> 00:02:19.977
"After he ate one of the donuts, he looked strange.

40
00:02:19.978 --> 00:02:25.120
He tried to bite another customer, so I chased him outside.

41
00:02:25.121 --> 00:02:28.100
Other people ate the donuts after that.

42
00:02:28.101 --> 00:02:32.157
The same thing happened to them."

43
00:02:32.158 --> 00:02:34.422
Detective Smith opened the case.

44
00:02:34.423 --> 00:02:36.969
He picked up a donut and studied it.

45
00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:40.226
"It looks like a regular donut to me."

46
00:02:40.227 --> 00:02:43.752
"Did this ever happen before?" Roxy asked.

47
00:02:43.753 --> 00:02:45.567
The woman shook her head.

48
00:02:45.568 --> 00:02:50.672
"Never. I just started ordering these donuts from a new bakery.

49
00:02:50.673 --> 00:02:53.553
These are the first ones I got."

50
00:02:53.554 --> 00:02:57.113
"What's the name of the bakery?" Detective Smith asked.

51
00:02:57.114 --> 00:02:59.588
"Le Sweet's," the woman said.

52
00:02:59.589 --> 00:03:03.621
"It's just outside the city, near the mountains."

53
00:03:03.622 --> 00:03:07.689
"I'll go and check it out," Roxy said.

54
00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:10.601
She ran out the door and flew off.

55
00:03:10.602 --> 00:03:14.544
Down the block she saw the door to Shop Well Supermarket fly open.

56
00:03:14.545 --> 00:03:21.221
A huge pack of zombies spilled out from the door!

